[0m[0m
[1mType Design[22m: The Rust [38;5;10mHamt<'a, T, U>[0m stores [38;5;10mBox<T>[0m and [38;5;10mBox<U>[0m internally in [38;5;10mHamtNode[0m variants (Leaf or Sub), while the public API uses generic [38;5;10mT[0m/[38;5;10mU[0m. The test code passes [38;5;10m&mut Box<T>[0m to methods, so the HAMT clones values into owned storage.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[1mCore Algorithm[22m: Translated the HAMT operations faithfully:[0m[0m
- [38;5;10mhamt_set[0m — inserts/replaces, returns conflict info via [38;5;10mKeyValue[0m out-param[0m[0m
- [38;5;10mhamt_search[0m — traverses the trie using bitmap + popcount for child indexing[0m[0m
- [38;5;10mhamt_remove[0m — removes and collapses single-child sub-nodes back to leaves[0m[0m
- [38;5;10mget_symbol[0m — extracts CHUNK_SIZE-bit chunks from the hash at each level[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[1mKey Adjustments[22m:[0m[0m
